<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσημαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw out hints of, intimate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.82
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεῶν ἀποκοπάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					566a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελιδὼν ὑ. τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					1.52
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				11
			</span></i>: abs., <i>indicate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθάπερ τοὔνομα αὐτὸ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1122a23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1112a16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in military
			sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάλπιγγι ὑ.</span>
			<i>make signal</i> by sound of trumpet, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ σάλπιγγι σιωπὴ ὑπεσημάνθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.32
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεσήμηνεν ἡ σάλπιγξ ἀνακλητικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Comp.Pel.Marc.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ σάλπιγξ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					49.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				1.35.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be just visible,</i> of the whites of the eyes, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.26.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sign,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστολῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					5.471.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(v/vi A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιττάκιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PKlein.Form.</u>
					1033
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>observe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὠυτὸ σχῆμα ἔχοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					3.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
